UniController's Bluetooth bridge derives from ps5-wireless-pads (AngelLopezTorres),
PadBridge PS5 (X-F1REBALL-X) and AnyPad-PS5 (sinfiltros), under GPL-3.0-or-later.
https://github.com/AngelLopezTorres/ps5-wireless-pads

Ghostcontrol (StonedModder and seregonwar) provided the early research on
creating a virtual DualSense and assigning it to a PS5 user.
https://github.com/StonedModder/Ghostcontrol-PS5-USB-Controller-Patcher

The web shortcut installer follows the TitleDir/InstallAll sequence from
itsPLK/ps5-payload-manager, via ps5-wireless-pads.

Bundled components:
- Alpine.js CSP 3.14.9 (MIT), web/vendor/ALPINE-LICENSE.md
- rxi/log.c 0.1.0 (MIT), vendor/rxi-log/LICENSE
- SDL controller identification headers (Valve Corporation, zlib),
  vendor/sdl/LICENSE.txt and vendor/sdl/README.md
